      "finding": "Postconstructor5argAB8530 is the wrong API inside raw93. Raw93 CPP371/NativeAB98D8 calls ctorphase storage_construct85; the later Glyph CPP433/NativeAB9D93 is a separate postconstructor call.",
      "action": "Use actual raw93 and constructor85 overloads; do not require a completed/bound postconstructor reference while constructor is in flight."
    },
    {
      "id": "CTOR_PHASE_2",
      "severity": "blocking proposed permission",
      "finding": "HeaderArm is not constructor-slot permission; public native_eh_state/provider_call and an SDK current object do not prove Native cause. Current Glyph state0 catch reachesAB76F0 on anyCpp escape from an opaque construct call, which may include host work.",
      "action": "Add a distinct exact slot-home-address arm; host/unknown retain; no Native issuer exists so positive predicate stays false."
    },
    {
      "id": "CTOR_PHASE_3",
      "severity": "blocking proposed boundary",
      "finding": "Raw93 Native body has returned before Source completed() checks atCPP372. Waiting for outer construct_00ab9650 normal return leaves added host binding/validation inside constructor slot epoch.",
      "action": "Private negative-only body-return bridge immediately afterCPP371 beforecompleted(), independently of Origin.complete and public phase."
    }
  ],
